WEBVTT

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:08.800
Since that summer day when the distance between us has shortened..

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.460
...I went through a lot of things.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.400
This is a story set in the not too distant future.

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:20.750
UMARUN

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:24.720
Well, the people who are curious about the rest...

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:28.000
...can buy and read the volumes that are now for sale.

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.860
Hey, can we really do this?

00:02:15.550 --> 00:02:19.960
June 2nd... isn't that the day that game releases?

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:23.980
Well, I didn't put much effort to mark this day anyway.

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:26.500
It's not that important to me... Uh!

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:29.400
Umaru! Your cake!

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:31.820
It's Onii-chan's birthday!

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:38.480
Couldn't I just not celebrate anything?

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:40.760
If I remember right, Onii-chan...

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:44.980
My birthday? It's not important. At my age it isn't that exciting.

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:46.980
...or so he said.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:48.860
But...

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:54.080
Don't worry, really. I don't want you to do anything for me.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.860
He seemed like he <i>really</i> wanted to celebrate it.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:02.520
Eh... I have to talk to you about something today, Ebina-chan.

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:05.600
Ah, is it about Onii-san's birthday?

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:07.660
It's almost here, isn't it?

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:10.020
Y-Yes.

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:13.020
And to think Ebina-chan remembered!

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:16.900
I can't think of anything to gift him.

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:19.340
And I don't have too much money.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:20.780
I see...

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:25.800
B-But if you put your heart into it, it doesn't have to be something expensive...

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.640
for example, something handmade.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:31.900
I also thought of something handmade, but I don't want it to be too overdone.

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:34.700
Eh? You're right...

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:39.360
If only Onii-chan had some hobbies it would be easier, but he doesn't.

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.860
He seems busy with work, after all...

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.840
Ah, why don't you gift him a card holder?

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:47.840
Well, he always uses his favorite one.

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:50.780
Why don't you gift something that makes him have a new hobby?

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:53.840
I don't think he would like that at all.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.280
Could it be...

00:03:56.280 --> 00:04:00.840
...that this is so hard because you know him too well?

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:07.520
T-T-That can't be true, Ebina-chan!

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:09.340
Eh? Uh...

00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:13.760
Just because I'm his sister doesn't mean that I know everything about him.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:19.200
Yes, you're right.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:24.380
I know! Do you have something you want to do with Onii-san?

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:26.220
With Onii-chan?

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:30.460
Maybe Onii-san wants to do whatever you want do.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:33.100
Something I want to do?

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:35.100
I'm home.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:39.200
Welcome home, Onii-chan! Let's play a game together!

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:42.040
I'm sorry, I had extra hours.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:46.600
You're hungry, right? I'll make dinner right away.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:48.220
Okay.

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:53.500
I... want to play with Onii-chan.

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:55.500
That's it, Umaru-chan!

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:57.900
Go play with Onii-san!

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:00.220
Play?

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:02.740
Well, why don't the three of us go somewhere...

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:05.580
No, it would be better that only you two go.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:07.220
R-Really?

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:10.560
Then you can also do whatever you want with Onii-chan!

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:13.780
Eh, w-whatever I want?

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:15.420
Thank you, Ebina-chan!

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:20.060
G-Giving him a gift is enough for me.

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:23.480
Ebina-chan, that's...

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:28.240
Yes, I made it by hand.

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:30.380
It's for Onii-san.

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:33.200
<i>I just told her that something handmade would be too much.</i>

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:37.100
Yes, I think something handmade is great after all!

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:42.120
I also made him a handkerchief...

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:44.000
...one for his bento...

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:46.220
...I also thought he would like a cover for his organizer...

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:47.620
...and a cushion...

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:50.220
She made so many!

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:16.120
Onii-chan, Omedetou! Happy Birthday!

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:23.200
Come on, you're older now!

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:25.560
Onii-chan, Onii-chan!

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:32.480
I've made a delicious cake for you!

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:35.140
Onii-chan, Onii-chan!

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:41.620
Onii-chan, Omedetou! Happy Birthday!

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:49.160
Special attack! Umaru dive!

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:53.260
What's going on? Something happened, Umaru?

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:00.400
Onii-chan!

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:03.710
I'm here, Onii-chan.

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:06.750
Did you wait long?

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:09.100
Why did I have to wait?

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:11.370
Couldn't we have gone out at the same time?

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:14.210
We girls take our time to get ready.

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:15.490
Onii-chan.

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:21.150
Happy birthday! I wanted to thank you today.

00:07:22.550 --> 00:07:24.050
O-Okay...

00:07:24.050 --> 00:07:28.300
Onii-chan, aren't you happy that a sister this cute congratulates you?

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:30.160
Of course I am happy.

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:37.270
<i>And to think that treating him well like this would work...</i>

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:40.150
<i>I was thinking too much with Ebina-chan for no reason.</i>

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:43.200
<i>Alright! If it's like this...</i>

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:45.200
Let's get going!

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:46.870
Wait!

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:49.700
ONII-CHAN!

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:52.710
How is it? It's the best, isn't it?

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:54.450
W-What are you doing?

00:07:54.930 --> 00:07:58.370
<i>Huh, why is he being so defensive?</i>

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:01.390
Anyway, let's go!

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:04.080
What's wrong? Is there something you want me to buy?

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:06.530
It's not that!

00:08:10.430 --> 00:08:13.550
We haven't gone out together in a while, right?

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:15.320
Well, that's right.

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:18.630
They're cute, Onii-chan!

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:20.520
Y-Yes...

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:22.750
Onii-chan, this one should fit you.

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:24.650
Do you think so?

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:29.390
You still got a lot of strength, Onii-chan!

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:31.880
Do you think so?

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:44.660
This is fun, right Onii-chan?

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:46.190
Yes, it's true.

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:52.210
<i>It's like he isn't here, maybe he isn't having that much fun.</i>

00:08:53.570 --> 00:08:56.320
Hey, Umaru! There's a game center over there.

00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:58.740
Do you want to go play? I'll pay.

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:00.740
I just got paid after all.

00:09:02.670 --> 00:09:06.900
Don't worry, you don't like game centers after all, right?

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:12.800
Alright, then I'll just spend all of my salary on the lottery.

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:14.130
What are you doing?

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:17.970
You won't win the lottery just because it's your birthday!

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:22.410
Do you know how many potato chips and cola can you buy with that money?

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.650
What are you laughing at, Onii-chan?

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:30.780
Just when I try to behave like a sister...

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:37.880
You don't need to pretend someone you're not in front of me.

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:41.010
Don't worry about that, <i>my sister</i>.

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:43.610
Onii-chan...

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:48.880
Let's go to the game center together!

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:51.660
Onii-chan?

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:53.720
Meanie!

00:09:56.290 --> 00:10:00.130
You really are a four-eyed meanie!

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:03.040
You're not going to pretend to be good anymore?

00:10:04.100 --> 00:10:06.530
That's right, this is who I am.

00:10:09.570 --> 00:10:11.780
Tomorrow is the start of summer vacation.

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:13.450
Summer vacation!

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:14.600
Great!

00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:15.920
Let's go to the beach!

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:17.920
Stay quiet, everyone!

00:10:18.310 --> 00:10:22.700
Summer vacations are important when you're in high school, so you have to plan them well.

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:25.970
Especially those who haven't had good results in your tests.

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:34.180
The teacher is such a mood killer, isn't she?

00:10:34.180 --> 00:10:36.640
That's right, she's horrible!

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:40.810
But in high school summer vacations are important.

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:42.550
That's true.

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:43.960
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:10:44.190 --> 00:10:47.600
<i>I wonder if after graduation I'll have to return to Akita...</i>

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:49.440
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:51.020
<i>From here on, what we talked before...</i>

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:56.190
<i>You don't need to pretend someone you're not in front of me.</i>

00:10:56.190 --> 00:11:00.500
<i>Should I continue keeping this a secret from everyone?</i>

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:02.930
What a mess!

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:05.350
We should go to the sea, don't you think?

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:08.340
What?

00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:11.510
Summer means sea after all!

00:11:11.510 --> 00:11:14.240
This time I want to go with everyone.

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:17.920
You were worrying about where should we go?

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:20.330
Of course!

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:23.790
Aren't you taking the summer course?

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:26.410
Why would I study on a summer vacation?

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:29.940
I can study anytime!

00:11:29.940 --> 00:11:32.850
Now is my chance to go out with everyone!

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:39.010
You're right. Let's go together!

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:41.900
Yes, I can study at night.

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:43.670
You say smart things sometimes.

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:45.620
Really?

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:48.170
Yes, but only once in a while.

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:49.920
Yes, once in a while.

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:52.150
What do you mean?

00:11:58.740 --> 00:12:02.030
So, why do we have a meeting so suddenly?

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:04.610
Is it to decide where to go for the summer vacation?

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:06.380
Ehem... Today's meeting...

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:08.370
If so, let's go to Okinawa!

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:10.030
I want to eat soki soba!

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:13.120
Think about the money, how much do you think it will cost?

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:15.120
I want to eat pork!

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:16.710
...so, I'm telling you...

00:12:17.430 --> 00:12:20.570
We could make Onii-chan take us to Hawaii.

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:22.940
He must be busy with work...

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:28.110
Maybe it's cheaper to go to Hawaii during season?

00:12:29.020 --> 00:12:30.820
I want to eat cake!

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:35.110
I'm telling you, we are not talking about traveling!

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:36.130
Then about what?

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:38.110
I'm...

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:42.710
I'm starting to think if I should keep pretending to be someone I'm not in front of everyone.

00:12:44.810 --> 00:12:49.400
Are you talking about the lazy Umaru, Komaru and U.M.R.?

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:56.450
Ebina-chan and the others aren't hiding anything, but I do.

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:59.010
Now that you mention it, Onii-chan said the same...

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:01.180
...that you don't need to pretend to be someone else.

00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:03.180
So, what do we do?

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:08.670
I...

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:11.380
I'm home!

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:14.870
Onii-chan is back! Welcome home!

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:16.870
She hasn't realized!

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:20.820
The electricity bill is so high during summer.

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:26.700
What's wrong?

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:32.020
Onii-chan, I want to go to this place with my friends!

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:38.910
It's the pool!

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:41.840
So this is the new pool...

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:43.750
This slide...

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:45.750
...looks like a roller coaster.

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:47.920
With this we can all ride it.

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:49.920
It's the pool!

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:51.920
Well girls, let's go!

00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:58.390
<i>Today I'll tell them the truth about me.</i>

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:03.990
Thank you for the food!

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:08.950
It's delicious, Onii-chan.

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:11.470
You... did anything happen?

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:13.520
Why do you say that?

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:17.930
It's just that... you're not little like usual.

00:14:17.930 --> 00:14:21.580
I decided that I won't be so lazy this year.

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:29.550
Onii-chan...

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:34.400
...do you keep secrets from your friends?

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:40.510
There are so many people!

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:44.610
I actually wanted to make Onii-chan be my bodyguard.

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:46.840
If he has to work, there's nothing we can do.

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:48.890
That's true.

00:14:48.890 --> 00:14:50.550
It's a shame, isn't it?

00:14:50.550 --> 00:14:52.550
But the four of us can have fun.

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:54.700
What are you talking about, Kirie-san?

00:14:55.650 --> 00:14:59.010
If it's something interesting, I want to hear it too!

00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:01.260
It's nothing.

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:04.340
Sylphin-san, aren't you hot from moving so much?

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:06.080
I'm alright.

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:08.570
Come on, let's go!

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:10.800
Yes, we have to change.

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:16.680
Let's swim!

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:21.300
Ebina-chan, hurry up!

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:23.300
Yes!

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:27.650
It's the pool!

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:30.050
Whoa! It's big!

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:32.440
Ebina-chan, are you alright?

00:15:32.440 --> 00:15:35.410
There are so many people!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:40.220
That group of girls are cute.

00:15:40.220 --> 00:15:42.350
The girl in the middle is super pretty!

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:44.430
Should we try talking with them?

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:52.100
<i>We shouldn't have let others see Umaru-san in a swimsuit.</i>

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:55.180
<i>I have to protect Umaru-san!</i>

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:05.190
Let's have lots of fun today!

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:08.250
Umaru-san, here I go!

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:09.590
Yes!

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:16.380
This is fun!

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:30.900
That was scary!

00:16:30.900 --> 00:16:32.370
But...

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:33.730
It was fun!

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:36.630
That's right! Are you okay, Ebina-chan?

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:38.920
Ebina-chan!

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:42.520
Now that I remember, Ebina-san can't swim.

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:44.280
I think you're right.

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:47.000
Even her name has "shrimp" on it.

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:49.010
That's not the point.

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:51.800
Are you alright, Ebina-chan?

00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:53.730
Get it together!

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:56.650
Are you alright?

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:58.650
Y-Yes.

00:16:58.650 --> 00:17:01.610
It was a bit scary, but it was fun.

00:17:01.610 --> 00:17:03.040
Ebina-chan...

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:04.480
Well said!

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:08.320
<i>It was fun.</i>

00:17:11.580 --> 00:17:13.380
You can do it, Kirie-chan!

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:15.300
Good job!

00:17:18.420 --> 00:17:20.280
I'm swimming too!

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:22.280
Please don't.

00:17:22.280 --> 00:17:24.160
Let's make a contest, Umaru-san!

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:26.970
Stop it, Sylphin-san!

00:17:27.430 --> 00:17:29.020
Alright, I'm taking it!

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:39.880
Ebina-chan!

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:43.640
<i>It's fun!</i>

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:51.950
<i>It's really fun.</i>

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:57.800
<i>I wasn't very good at making friends.</i>

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:01.480
<i>Despite that, I always went unnoticed...</i>

00:18:02.160 --> 00:18:06.110
<i>...you all have believed in me and played with me.</i>

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:12.660
<i>Ebina-chan...</i>

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:14.740
<i>...Kirie-chan...</i>

00:18:15.210 --> 00:18:17.180
<i>...Sylphin-san...</i>

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:19.260
<i>...I love you all!</i>

00:18:22.460 --> 00:18:24.020
<i>Because I love you....</i>

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:26.020
<i>...I have to tell you.</i>

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:27.900
Umaru-chan?

00:18:28.300 --> 00:18:29.550
I...

00:18:29.550 --> 00:18:32.280
I have something to tell you all.

00:18:32.280 --> 00:18:34.170
She really is going to tell them...

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:38.520
...that Umaru, Komaru and U.M.R. are the same person.

00:18:38.730 --> 00:18:39.960
Y-Yes.

00:18:40.630 --> 00:18:42.720
What's going to happen when she tells them?

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:45.060
She won't be able to be lazy anymore?

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:48.190
Maybe they be will upset.

00:18:48.190 --> 00:18:51.730
Or maybe they will stop talking to her.

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:53.780
E-Even so...

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:56.130
Umaru-chan?

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:58.400
What do you want to tell us?

00:19:01.090 --> 00:19:03.560
You might hate me for this.

00:19:06.430 --> 00:19:07.630
What should she say?

00:19:07.630 --> 00:19:10.180
Meeting again?

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:13.230
Something like "they were all me, I'm sorry"?

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:16.290
What if she transforms into Komaru in front of everyone?

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:17.710
Let's do this!

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:22.440
When she comes out of the pool, she transforms into Komaru.

00:19:22.440 --> 00:19:24.440
Good idea!

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:29.130
What do you mean we're going to hate you?

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:32.620
<i>You're all my dear friends.</i>

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:35.700
<i>That's why I can't keep this hidden anymore.</i>

00:19:36.470 --> 00:19:37.810
<i>But...</i>

00:19:37.810 --> 00:19:41.730
<i>...If I tell everyone, and I lose my relationship with them...</i>

00:19:42.810 --> 00:19:45.020
<i>I don't want to, I'm scared!</i>

00:19:45.020 --> 00:19:46.900
<i>I don't want to be hated!</i>

00:19:46.900 --> 00:19:48.320
<i>Onii-chan!</i>

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:56.530
<i>Ki-Kirie-chan, I actually... I...</i>

00:19:59.270 --> 00:20:01.440
I... I...

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:03.570
Y-You don't have to say it!

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:10.340
I... not sure if I can say it...

00:20:10.340 --> 00:20:14.990
I don't even know what you are trying to say, but...

00:20:14.990 --> 00:20:18.830
I don't want to see you suffer, Umaru-san!

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:27.610
I also believe that you don't need to suffer that much.

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:31.130
After all, we all have our secrets.

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:35.200
That's right, we wouldn't hate you!

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:42.240
We will all love you, no matter what happens!

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:48.150
Umaru-san?

00:20:59.090 --> 00:21:00.760
<i>I love you all!</i>

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:06.050
<i>I'm really glad that you're my friends.</i>

00:21:09.360 --> 00:21:12.910
So... you'll be showing a different face to everyone after all?

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:17.100
I believe I don't need to force myself to tell them...

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:20.910
I think that's fine, if that's what you have decided.

00:21:21.870 --> 00:21:23.270
Onii-chan...

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:27.160
What's most important is that you have asked yourself the hard question.

00:21:28.490 --> 00:21:31.530
Besides, you haven't lied to them, right?

00:21:31.530 --> 00:21:35.590
All of those faces are a part of you...

00:21:35.590 --> 00:21:37.970
...my dear little sister.

00:21:39.850 --> 00:21:41.150
Onii-chan...

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:44.410
Okay.

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:47.180
Right, about yesterday's question...

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:51.230
I also keep some things hidden from my friends.

00:21:52.260 --> 00:21:56.510
I don't think I'll stop being someone's friend just because that person has secrets.

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:01.960
Why didn't you say that before?

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:05.500
I thought it would be good that you realized that yourself.

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:08.390
Meanie! You're meanie, Onii-chan!

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:11.670
Stupid four-eyed weakling!

00:22:11.670 --> 00:22:13.960
You! What are you calling your brother?
